"/robot-descriptions-common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/README.md) 以及 "
"deploy-ws / 控制器 README。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/3-naming_conventions.md:5
#: 45eabe81874946768ca7a6095904f881
msgid ""
"Brand **EN/ZH** labels follow [robot_usds README_zh-CN.md "
"§3.1](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README_zh-"
"CN.md#31-中文简称与英文标识对照). **ARX** is 方舟无限 (not bare “Ark”). **HighTorque** /"
" Panthera is 高擎. Repo and script names stay as quoted (`arx-lift2s`, "
"`./init_repo.sh`)."
msgstr ""
"品牌中英对照遵循 [robot_usds README_zh-CN.md §3.1](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README_zh-CN.md#31-中文简称与英文标识对照)。**ARX** "
"是方舟无限（不要用单独的 “Ark”）。**HighTorque** / Panthera 是高擎。`arx-lift2s` "
"等软件包/分支路径在引用命令时保持原样。"

